<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

<title>FLUXCUP</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{

background:#0b0b0b;
color:white;
font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
overflow-x:hidden;

}

/* Noise */

body::before{

content:"";
position:fixed;
left:0;
top:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
pointer-events:none;
opacity:.06;

background-image:url("https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/asfalt-dark.png");

}

/* Navigation */

nav{

position:fixed;

top:30px;
left:50%;
transform:translateX(-50%);

display:flex;
gap:50px;

z-index:999;

backdrop-filter:blur(20px);

padding:15px 30px;

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);

border-radius:100px;

background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);

}

nav a{

color:white;
text-decoration:none;
letter-spacing:2px;
font-size:13px;
transition:.3s;

}

nav a:hover{

color:#ff3d3d;

}

/* Hero */

.hero{

height:100vh;

display:flex;

justify-content:center;
align-items:center;

flex-direction:column;

text-align:center;

padding:40px;

}

.hero h1{

font-size:clamp(60px,13vw,180px);

line-height:.9;

font-weight:700;

text-transform:uppercase;

}

.hero p{

margin-top:40px;

font-size:22px;

opacity:.7;

max-width:700px;

}

.scroll{

margin-top:80px;

font-size:14px;

letter-spacing:4px;

animation:float 2s infinite;

}

@keyframes float{

50%{

transform:translateY(12px);

}

}

/* Sections */

section{

padding:120px 8%;

}

/* About */

.about{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;

gap:60px;

align-items:center;

}

.about h2{

font-size:70px;

margin-bottom:30px;

}

.about p{

line-height:1.8;

font-size:18px;

opacity:.75;

}

/* Gallery */

.gallery{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));

gap:30px;

}

.card{

height:420px;

overflow:hidden;

position:relative;

cursor:pointer;

background:#111;

}

.card img{

width:100%;
height:100%;

object-fit:cover;

transition:.6s;

filter:grayscale(100%);

}

.card:hover img{

transform:scale(1.1);

filter:grayscale(0);

}

.overlay{

position:absolute;

bottom:0;

left:0;

padding:25px;

background:linear-gradient(transparent,black);

width:100%;

}

.overlay h3{

font-size:30px;

}

/* Statement */

.statement{

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

text-align:center;

min-height:80vh;

}

.statement h2{

font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,90px);

max-width:900px;

line-height:1.1;

}

/* Contact */

.contact{

text-align:center;

}

.contact h2{

font-size:70px;

margin-bottom:40px;

}

button{

background:white;

color:black;

padding:18px 45px;

font-size:16px;

border:none;

cursor:pointer;

transition:.3s;

}

button:hover{

background:#ff3d3d;

color:white;

}

/* Footer */

footer{

padding:60px;

text-align:center;

opacity:.5;

}

@media(max-width:900px){

.about{

grid-template-columns:1fr;

}

.about h2{

font-size:50px;

}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<nav>

<a href="#about">ABOUT</a>

<a href="#works">WORKS</a>

<a href="#statement">STATEMENT</a>

<a href="#contact">CONTACT</a>

</nav>

<section class="hero">

<h1>FLUXCUP</h1>

<p>

Visual Artist • Video Art • Illustration

</p>

<div class="scroll">

SCROLL

</div>

</section>

<section id="about" class="about">

<div>

<h2>Artist</h2>

</div>

<div>

<p>

FluxCup explores absurdity, memory, digital identity, and pop culture through illustration, moving images, and experimental storytelling.

Each project is treated as an open conversation between nostalgia, humor, and discomfort.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section id="works">

<div class="gallery">

<div class="card">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513364776144-60967b0f800f">

<div class="overlay">

<h3>Illustration</h3>

</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499364615650-ec38552f4f34">

<div class="overlay">

<h3>Video Art</h3>

</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517048676732-d65bc937f952">

<div class="overlay">

<h3>Installation</h3>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section id="statement" class="statement">

<h2>

"Failure is merely another visual language."

</h2>

</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">

<h2>

Let's Collaborate

</h2>

<button>

Send Email

</button>

</section>

<footer>

© FLUXCUP 2026

</footer>

<script>

document.querySelectorAll(".card").forEach(card=>{

card.addEventListener("mousemove",(e)=>{

const x=e.offsetX/card.clientWidth*30;

const y=e.offsetY/card.clientHeight*30;

card.style.transform=`rotateY(${x-15}deg) rotateX(${15-y}deg)`;

});

card.addEventListener("mouseleave",()=>{

card.style.transform="rotateY(0deg) rotateX(0deg)";

});

});

</script>

</body>
</html>
